{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "86f4b15de0093f11fa6354e860ed8b5f0e18b6cd30feeef05b5c125d1ed98d13", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん、\n{$P$}さんっ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9593638bebc1155ede369616f6414a20303fac55bb618eaeaee273451f135bff", "ja": "ああ、青羽さん。どうしました？\nもしかして、また社長が俺のことを？", "zh": "哦哦，青羽小姐，怎么了吗？\n该不会社长又要找我过去了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "c90d750275534357ef8bf8676782c558eec88ed991b6362687d5d445735ada7b", "ja": "はい、そうなんです。それと……あのう……\n今夜は、何時くらいまで仕事していきますか？", "zh": "是的，就是这样。还有……请问……\n你今晚会工作到几点呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d3664037d08603ade6d91a4e5f9f51a87722522000a578de522aa72ef2e2e830", "ja": "へ？　えーと……今日は書類がたまってるんで\nちょっと残業して帰ろうかと思ってたんですが……。", "zh": "咦？我想想……今天有好多文件没处理，\n我应该会加班一下再回去吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8ce1130c625df7484e76fdd78cc12093604f47bb51c8240a19e47ccff08332f9", "ja": "もしかして、さっさと帰った方がいいですか？", "zh": "还是你希望我早点下班回家呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "87d3ccbe52b75fb2ddc12fe4f95f313cf8747ac08c943e30824069223f260b4d", "ja": "いっ、いえいえ！　そんなことないです！\nどうぞ、ごゆ～っくり！　えへ、えへへっ。", "zh": "不、不是不是！我不是这个意思！\n请你慢慢加班吧～！嘿嘿、嘿嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "92a03bb45e9d70008b9d231b03cc27256dcfb4cd05eee9ef94aa852d7b7b0af9", "ja": "はあ……？", "zh": "好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1007_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f466e9f905899206458da73d3cba7ea24abe24fbaffca20cca0e276003293418", "ja": "社長、呼びましたか……って、あれ？", "zh": "社长，你找我吗……咦？奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "171b256c27eda8c2820ecc660294ebf8ecb8de0ac073ed5c8aa2cf1655590c95", "ja": "……つーん。", "zh": "……哼──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "29331de4955d98a6d536d9ec0f9ae41c40605a77285411a8d1daebca9b51de11", "ja": "お、音無くぅん。そろそろ機嫌を直してくれないかね？\nほら、彼も来てしまったことだし……。", "zh": "音、音无，你是不是也该消气了呢？\n你看，他都已经来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b97a7002eabf7a8018edc68f3d0c295e62ea334b6f07757c2302b28054aba859", "ja": "音無さん、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "音无小姐，发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "e5814d65ce5b7c75f0fd34fbedb424635b7c2ce3f1d6f71256bb2b2e7c825c1a", "ja": "いやあ、それがね……。", "zh": "唉，是这样的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "de14a6c8ef8a7b306f6765646495a371d76489aca299531f35808ca15a8ff879", "ja": "社長ってば、私が読んでた『戦慄のマッドドクター』の\n結末、先にしゃべっちゃったんですっ。", "zh": "社长太过分了，居然把我看到一半的\n《战栗的疯狂医生》的结局讲出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "a2dc5013297c3006af98821e0e710eece2027c21e5e44641ff14d213b76e7b79", "ja": "ホラーサスペンスの結末を先にしゃべっちゃうなんて、\nあんまりだと思いませんか！？", "zh": "竟然把恐怖悬疑小说的结局讲出来，\n这样是不是很过分！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "04334b8ad1360203a1d737fcb1877222ddd7edc7196cccac872dc20b84a509ed", "ja": "え、ネタバレしちゃったんですか？\nそれはまずいですよ、社長……。", "zh": "什么？社长剧透了吗？\n这样不对啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "0061a02081da6885dbf0628bd77b92c455189071813f310ed8bcc5f154f25e38", "ja": "いやあ、面目ない！\nてっきりもう読み終わったものとばかり……。", "zh": "唉，真是惭愧！\n我还以为音无已经看完了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "c4735a1eaa65ffa3592da60dc1a38a1d343342607664c93595f5ff1a9824ad5c", "ja": "あんなにぞくぞくする作品は久しぶりだったのでね。\n誰かと感想を語り合いたかったのだよ。", "zh": "因为我很久没看到这么紧张刺激的作品，\n所以才想找个人讨论感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c4cabea9100db922bd568f9d551d7ad89e163ca8aacc42ead35d8c9483efe92a", "ja": "へえ……そんなに面白い小説なんですか？", "zh": "这样啊……那本小说有这么好看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "f3c6c8521423fe4d75ec7eb567e3839a5491c313cc82a1707cfb3d4be79256b4", "ja": "ええ。最近、舞台化も決まったそうですよ。\n今は美咲ちゃんに貸してますけど、次、読んでみます？", "zh": "是啊，最近听说还决定要改编成舞台剧了。\n现在借给美咲看了，之后再借你看看吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "26c1d2ddbcf35c9dd2f0ffda2d0783bbf8369077716a402e1532d07dfa13b9d7", "ja": "おっと、そうだ。舞台といえば……\n君を呼んだ理由をまだ話していなかったね。", "zh": "哦，对了，说到舞台剧……\n我还没说为何要找你过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "afdd4222f45fea9efae5048958ed2c5f9770e7cbd403edb6bc62654df06a905c", "ja": "実は、先日アイドル諸君に受けてもらった\nオーディションの結果が届いたのだよ。", "zh": "是这样的，\n前阵子偶像们参加试镜的结果已经送来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "bfc0b7ddaf62e76c586cf491cf7669c5f1143bc909956c80c7a5418fb3b2dc27", "ja": "オーディション……\nということは、もしかして、あの映画の！", "zh": "试镜……\n这么说，莫非是那部电影的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "49b4f2993eaeca66220bd84b795cc5795eaac2138962c531f24e6dd6663bb247", "ja": "うむ！　劇場を舞台とした新作サスペンス\n『屋根裏の道化師』！", "zh": "没错！故事舞台设定在剧场的全新悬疑片，\n《阁楼里的小丑》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "8e237b15d5c95fa698c0b24bd4e38326375345b6f11773454bc116ecf6e11f3c", "ja": "その映画に、我が765プロから\n7名のアイドルが出演することが決まった。", "zh": "我们765艺能将派出七位偶像\n拍摄那部电影。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "a31c04875e245cb68fc75d6734484573183f0fa5085d85d2b73822ec1515feaa", "ja": "そこで君には、彼女達が存分に実力を発揮できるよう\nサポートしてもらいたい。頼めるかね？", "zh": "我想请你好好协助她们，\n让她们能尽情发挥实力，可以麻烦你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_1026", "source_sha256": "9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3", "ja": "もちろんです！", "zh": "当然没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "5eb5434cd31d7531b3bb5875f424b80119b8b1960c3a94aa389862978e367648", "ja": "もちろんです！　あのオーディションは、厳しいもの\nでしたからね。アイドル達もはりきると思います。", "zh": "当然没问题！能通过那么严的试镜，\n我想她们一定也都感到跃跃欲试。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "6d54e7820201783b73f7e7ebbae31f49c284c3fe26ae7d20e6cfc38e8f1014d5", "ja": "うむ。今回は何しろ、サスペンス。\n繊細な表現を要求される役も、少なくない……。", "zh": "嗯，总之呢，这次是悬疑作品。\n许多角色都需要细腻的表演方式……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "2c1c6229aa193df5d7b3c42b37f4153961a08eb300357c0a04da26abcbbf4fa6", "ja": "だがそれだけに、アイドル諸君にとっても、\nまたとない成長のチャンスとなるだろう！", "zh": "但也因为如此，对各位偶像来说，\n这也是绝无仅有的成长机会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "c56e301e8873808599c1cddf6e229c46ffd56726280ef99dc1980581d7edc976", "ja": "はい！　みんながいい演技をできるよう、\n俺も力を尽くします。", "zh": "是！我也会全力支援，\n让大家能发挥出优秀的演技。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_2004_101kot", "source_sha256": "fae233cba867772d70b59658df6de974ee4e7c6f7f3a0d4ea6260eec032ebfb0", "ja": "どんな映画になるのか、楽しみですね♪\n頑張ってください、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "真期待拍出来的电影成果如何♪\n请你要加油喔，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_2005_p", "source_sha256": "5a43a935db91f8b77db5b72d7c3b604f2a2c27778dc9a5d4641e7cfa786aa647", "ja": "（『屋根裏の道化師』は、\n恐ろしい殺人事件を描いたサスペンス映画だ）", "zh": "（《阁楼里的小丑》是部\n描写可怕杀人事件的悬疑电影。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0058_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0058_story_intro_2006_p", "source_sha256": "11389832824988e1c575a2b3a4a91b18bb6078370a4678d72c1b5df1fd286ebb", "ja": "（もしかしたら、みんなの新しい一面を\n見ることができるかもしれないな……！）", "zh": "（说不定，\n能透过这次拍摄看到大家崭新的一面……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
